<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_768e18f1eeabdbc60efa436a98e404979a7b66e6f8b22133183e14bad0dcbfba_n0020/e_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/entityType> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/TEST_OR_MEASUREMENT> .
